Class DataVersionService:
- own active version lookup and lazy bootstrap behavior

Function get_active_version:
- read active version from DB or bootstrap from local manifest when empty

Function list_versions:
- list versions and bootstrap one record on an empty database

Function get_version:
- fetch a specific data_version if known

Function _bootstrap_current_version:
- read manifest.json
- create one active data_versions row using current source_root

Function _resolve_source_root:
- choose local root or S3 root from Settings

Function _build_manifest_object_key:
- build the persisted manifest path/key string

Function _extract_patch_version:
- read optional patch_versions data if present in manifest
